sicalState":{"langualCode":"E0162","langualCodeDescription":"Powder"},"productType":{"langualCode":"A1325","langualCodeDescription":"Other Combinations"},"productVersionCode":"CODE 170268 KKG","servingSizes":[{"order":1,"minQuantity":36,"maxQuantity":36,"minDailyServings":1,"maxDailyServings":1,"unit":"Gram(s)","notes":"2 rounded scoops","inSFB":true}],"servingsPerContainer":"30","src":"api/label/1060","statements":[{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"\"Many men - even if they try to make healthy food choices - aren't getting the vitamins, minerals and other nutrients their bodies need for optimal health. Mega Men(R) Sport combines multivitamin and mineral support with protein, fiber and beneficial nutrients. It's the best men's multivitamin available.\""},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"*These statements have not been evalutated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Formula re: Type","notes":"MEN'S"},{"type":"Formula re: Type","notes":"Premium formula designed for men who exercise regularly - Fuels lean muscle with 10 g of protein* - Supports recovery with L-glutamine* - Electrolyte replacement to fuel performance* - 1,000 mg of L-arginine to boost nitric oxide* - Promotes energy and metabolism*"},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Manufactured on equipment which processes products containing milk, egg, soybeans, shellfish, fish oil, tree nuts and peanut flavor."},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"CONTAINS: Milk, Soybeans and Wheat."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"KEEP OUT OF REACH OF CHILDREN."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Calories per gram: Fat 9 - Carbohydrates 4 - Protein 4"},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"CODE 170268 KKG"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Dr. Frank J. Costa, M.D., an internationally acclaimed urological surgeon and men’s health expert, is part of the GNC Medical Advisory Board."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"GNC GUARANTEE Use any GNC supplement for as little as 10 days. If you are not 100% completely satisfied, return the unused portion of the product with proof of purchase to your GNC store for a complete refund of your purchase price. No questions asked!"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"MEGA MEN(R) SPORT Adequate nutrition is essential for both optimal health and athletic performance. Mega Men(R) Sport is the premium formula for physically active men whose bodies demand more than a multivitamin alone. Muscle Fuel - Features 10 g of protein, a compound providing a positive nitrogen balance in the body. Along with exercise, protein is a quality fuel for lean body mass.* - Features a creatine precursor blend that supports the body’s natural production of creatine, which plays an important role in protein synthesis.* Recovery Support - Enhanced with electrolytes which help to regulate body fluids.* Intense exercise can result in a loss of these valuable electrolytes, leading to muscle cramping. - Provides L-glutamine and branched chain amino acids (BCAA) that fuel muscle and help to reduce the amount of protein breakdown during intense exercise.* Sexual Health - Features 1,000 mg of L-arginine, an important amino acid and building block of nitric oxide which helps maintain blood vessel tone and plays a key role in sexual health.* Energy and Metabolism - Includes green tea and B-vitamins that are involved in energy production and carbohydrate metabolism.* Carbohydrates are an important fuel and primary source of energy during intense exercise. Immune Defense - Boosts the body's immunity with zinc, selenium and vitamins C and E.* - Enhanced with antioxidants that fight cell-damaging free radicals.*"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Natural Flavor"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"NEW"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"NOTICE: Significant product settling may occur."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"One of “American’s Top Physicians,” Dr. Costa lectures nationally and internationally on men’s health topics. Dr. Costa is regularly featured in television, radio and newspaper interviews and has published articles in both professional journals and popular magazines."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"DIRECTIONS: As a dietary supplement, mix two rounded scoops (36g) with 8 - fl. oz. of cold water or preferred cold beverage daily. Stir briskly or shake well in a closed container until completely mixed. May vary amount of liquid depending on thickness desired."}],"targetGroups":["Adult Male (18-50 Years)"],"thumbnail":"","upcSku":"0 48107 09181 1","userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"_source":"api"}